    <item>
      <title>Squeak 2.14.3</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 09:46:34 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>21403</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.14.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>html{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#18181b;background:transparent;margin:0;padding:4px 2px}ul{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 10px}h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#52525b;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}code{font:12px ui-monospace,'SF Mono',monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:6px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f4f4f5}h4{color:#a1a1aa;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}}</style></head><body><ul><li>A denser sidebar in the style of Conductor: tighter project, worktree and chat rows, a chevron and worktree count on project headers, and a softer selected row.</li><li>A working chat shows the pixel matrix as its mark in the sidebar, the menu-bar panel and the command palette, and holds still when the window is in the background or Reduce Motion is on.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.14.2</h4><ul><li>Running chat tabs show a crisp monochrome pixel matrix beside the title and provider marker, with softly fading edges.</li><li>Chat tabs keep their positions through activity updates, workspace switches and app relaunches. New chats append on the right; drag a tab onto another to move it before that tab.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.14.1</h4><ul><li>Matrix activity fades softly to transparent on every edge, with crisp pixels and no visible box boundary.</li></ul><ul><li>Running tabs and worktrees now show an abstract animated pixel matrix: flowing cells and fading trails, with no letters or punctuation. Reduce Motion keeps the pattern still.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://sibhimanyu.github.io/squeak/download/Squeak-2.14.3.dmg" length="67595896" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="yj/FPQdEfCCs7sjdVJsjE6FHbfx4ZONWwScN6kFwcwVFclNVWkbEA/i8Qg+qcM4zpU4K1CAQ45HbNhX5ekTQCA==" />
    </item>
